<title>USA: Receptagen CEO resigns to join other firm.</title>
<headline>Receptagen CEO resigns to join other firm.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Receptagen Ltd said that Chairman and Chief Executive Albert Chiasson has resigned to join another North American pharmaceutical company as president and chief executive.</p>
<p>The company said its president, Warren Wheeler, will succeed Chiasson and remain company president.</p>
<p>It said Chiasson's vacancy on the board &quot;will be resolved when the board convenes in the very near future.&quot;</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
